---
layout: hub-page.njk
permalink: /guides/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Exam prep and guides"
pageTitle: "Free Claude Exam Guides and Practice Questions | Harisankar Sivankutty"
description: "Free prep for the Claude certifications: study guides and practice question banks for CCAR-F, CCAR-P and CCDV-F, with Google Cloud, data engineering and Databricks guides on the way."
---
{#- Exam prep library, after charliehills.ai/free-resources, grouped by exam:
    each Claude exam (exams.json) shows its free study guide next to its
    practice pack; then the guides still being written (brainbyte.tracks
    without a live guide) and a signup. -#}
{%- set liveTrackSlugs = [] -%}
{%- for g in bbLiveGuides %}{% set liveTrackSlugs = (liveTrackSlugs.push(g.track), liveTrackSlugs) %}{% endfor -%}

<header class="gl-head" id="hero">
  <p class="hub-label">Free · {{ site.newsletter.name }}</p>
  <h1 class="hub-h2">Exam prep and <span class="hub-accent">guides</span></h1>
  <p class="hub-sub">Everything for each Claude certification in one place: a study guide that shows how the exam thinks, and a practice question bank to test yourself. One free sign-up opens every guide.</p>
</header>

<div class="gl-body">
  <div class="hub-shelf">
    <div class="hub-shelf-head"><p class="hub-label">Claude certifications</p></div>
    <div class="ep-grid">
      {%- for exam in exams %}{% include "exam-prep-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hub-practice hub-practice-under">
    <div class="hub-glass hub-light hub-next" id="next">
      <span class="hub-label">More guides on the way</span>
      <ul class="hub-next-list">
        {%- for t in brainbyte.tracks %}{% if t.slug not in liveTrackSlugs %}
        <li>
          <span class="hub-course-logo"><img src="{{ t.logo }}" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" /></span>
          <span><b>{{ t.title }}</b><small>{{ t.level }} · {{ t.modules.length }} modules</small></span>
        </li>
        {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-glass hub-light hub-next" id="join">
      <span class="hub-label">Hear first</span>
      <p class="hub-tile-text">New guides and practice packs go to {{ site.newsletter.name }} subscribers first. {{ site.newsletter.tagline }}, a new issue {{ site.newsletter.cadence }}. Free.</p>
      {% set nfId = 'guides' %}{% set nfClass = 'bg-gate-form' %}{% set nfBtnClass = 'pf-btn pf-btn-primary' %}{% include "newsletter-form.njk" %}
      <p class="hub-meta">Unsubscribe any time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="hub-meta" style="margin-top:24px">Independent study material, not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic. Contains no actual exam questions.</p>
</div>
